This project is based on the public repository
https://github.com/hendrix-w-team/discord-bot (commit 6016c53, December 2025),
whose package.json declares the MIT license and names "Hendrix" as the author.
That repository contains no LICENSE file.

The code has since been changed substantially: start-up fixes, a database
schema, signature binding, rollup resolution through the Registry, a local
backup, status-job corrections, colleague management, provider registration
through the StakingRegistry, and tests.
